---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import LegalIdentity from '../components/LegalIdentity.astro';
import { AUTHOR_NAME, CONTACT_EMAIL, LAST_UPDATED, LEGAL, SITE_URL } from '../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../i18n/routes';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title="Legal notice: publisher and host of Stamp Duty Australia calculator" description="Publisher, hosting provider, limitation of liability and use of this independent stamp duty calculator for the eight Australian states and territories, updated 2026." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Legal notice' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h1>Legal notice</h1>
    <h2>Publisher</h2>
    <LegalIdentity lang={lang} />
    <p>Publication director: {AUTHOR_NAME}, for the content published on {SITE_URL}.</p>
    <h2>Host</h2>
    <LegalIdentity mode="hosting" lang={lang} />
    <h2>Nature of the service</h2>
    <p>The site provides free estimates of transfer duty (stamp duty), surcharges and first home grants in the Australian states and territories, from the rates published by each revenue office. An estimate is not an assessment, not legal, tax or financial advice, and does not replace the notice issued by the revenue office or the advice of a conveyancer or solicitor. The site is independent and is not affiliated with any government. Method and limits: <a href={route('method', lang)}>methodology</a>.</p>
    <h2>Liability</h2>
    <p>Rates are read at the source and the engine is tested against official calculators, without any guarantee that no error remains. The publisher is not liable for a decision made solely on the basis of an estimate. Report errors through the <a href={route('contact', lang)}>contact page</a>.</p>
    <h2>Reuse and embedding</h2>
    <p>Texts and code remain the publisher's property; short quotations with a link are welcome. The calculator can be embedded free of charge with its credit link visible: <a href={route('widget', lang)}>embed page</a>. Content quoted from government sites remains subject to the licence shown on those sites.</p>
    <h2>Contact and governing law</h2>
    <p><a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>. The publisher is established in {LEGAL.country}; French law applies, without prejudice to the mandatory consumer protections of your place of residence. Updated: {LAST_UPDATED}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
